WEBVTT

00:00:01.794 --> 00:00:04.155
YOU'LL BE SERVING DETENTION
WITH HAGRID TONIGHT.

00:00:04.198 --> 00:00:06.244
HE'S GOT
A LITTLE JOB TO DO

00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:09.856
INSIDE THE DARK FOREST.

00:00:11.902 --> 00:00:13.512
A SORRY LOT THIS,
HAGRID.

00:00:16.776 --> 00:00:18.082
OH, GOOD GOD, MAN,
YOU'RE NOT STILL ON

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:19.779
ABOUT THAT BLOODY
DRAGON, ARE YOU?

00:00:19.823 --> 00:00:23.348
[SNIFFLES]

00:00:23.391 --> 00:00:25.655
NORBERT'S GONE.

00:00:25.698 --> 00:00:28.092
DUMBLEDORE SENT HIM
OFF TO ROMANIA

00:00:28.135 --> 00:00:29.659
TO LIVE IN A COLONY.

00:00:29.702 --> 00:00:31.182
WELL, THAT'S GOOD,
ISN'T IT?

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:32.705
HE'LL BE
WITH HIS OWN KIND.

00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:35.360
YEAH, BUT WHAT IF
HE DON'T LIKE ROMANIA?

00:00:35.403 --> 00:00:38.581
WHAT IF THE OTHER DRAGONS
ARE MEAN TO HIM?

00:00:38.624 --> 00:00:40.234
HE'S ONLY A BABY,
AFTER ALL.

00:00:40.278 --> 00:00:43.542
OH, FOR GOD'S SAKE,
PULL YOURSELF TOGETHER, MAN.

00:00:43.586 --> 00:00:46.197
YOU'RE GOING INTO
THE FOREST, AFTER ALL.

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.721
GOT TO HAVE
YOUR WITS ABOUT YOU.

00:00:48.765 --> 00:00:51.724
THE FOREST?
I THOUGHT THAT WAS A JOKE.

00:00:51.768 --> 00:00:53.378
WE CAN'T GO IN THERE.

00:00:53.421 --> 00:00:56.599
STUDENTS AREN'T ALLOWED.

00:00:56.642 --> 00:00:57.817
AND THERE ARE--

00:00:57.861 --> 00:01:00.211
[HOWLING]

00:01:00.254 --> 00:01:01.691
WEREWOLVES!

00:01:01.734 --> 00:01:05.216
THERE'S MORE THAN WEREWOLVES
IN THOSE TREES, LAD.

00:01:05.259 --> 00:01:07.044
YOU CAN BE SURE OF THAT.

00:01:09.046 --> 00:01:11.657
NIGHTY-NIGHT.

00:01:14.225 --> 00:01:15.182
Hagrid: RIGHT.

00:01:15.226 --> 00:01:17.620
LET'S GO.

00:01:55.179 --> 00:01:57.703
HAGRID, WHAT IS THAT?

00:01:57.747 --> 00:02:01.315
WHAT WE'RE HERE FOR.
SEE THAT?

00:02:01.359 --> 00:02:04.144
THAT'S UNICORN BLOOD,
THAT IS.

00:02:04.188 --> 00:02:07.104
I FOUND ONE DEAD
A FEW WEEKS AGO.

00:02:07.147 --> 00:02:12.326
NOW, THIS ONE'S BEEN
HURT BAD BY SOMETHING.

00:02:15.112 --> 00:02:17.680
[HOWLING]

00:02:19.725 --> 00:02:24.034
SO, IT'S OUR JOB TO GO

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:25.688
AND FIND THE POOR BEAST.

00:02:25.731 --> 00:02:27.559
RON, HERMIONE,
YOU'LL COME WITH ME.

00:02:27.602 --> 00:02:28.821
OK.

00:02:28.865 --> 00:02:31.171
AND, HARRY,
YOU'LL GO WITH MALFOY.

00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:35.741
OK, THEN I GET FANG.

00:02:35.785 --> 00:02:37.743
FINE.

00:02:37.787 --> 00:02:40.354
JUST SO'S YOU KNOW,
HE'S A BLOODY COWARD.

00:02:40.398 --> 00:02:43.314
[FANG WHINING]

00:02:45.446 --> 00:02:48.101
YOU WAIT TILL MY FATHER
HEARS ABOUT THIS.

00:02:48.145 --> 00:02:49.842
THIS IS SERVANT'S STUFF.

00:02:49.886 --> 00:02:52.976
IF I DIDN'T
KNOW BETTER, DRACO,

00:02:53.019 --> 00:02:54.891
I'D SAY
YOU WERE SCARED.

00:02:54.934 --> 00:02:56.980
SCARED, POTTER?

00:02:57.023 --> 00:02:58.721
[HOWLING]

00:02:58.764 --> 00:03:00.244
DO YOU HEAR THAT?

00:03:02.463 --> 00:03:04.727
Draco: COME ON, FANG.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.685
SCARED.

00:03:29.229 --> 00:03:31.188
[FANG GROWLING]

00:03:31.231 --> 00:03:34.060
WHAT IS IT, FANG?

00:03:38.282 --> 00:03:40.414
[GASPS]

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:47.160
AAH!

00:03:47.204 --> 00:03:48.553
AAH! AAH!

00:03:49.989 --> 00:03:52.078
Draco: HELP!

00:03:57.954 --> 00:04:01.000
Draco: AAH!

00:04:20.672 --> 00:04:23.196
[HOOFBEATS]

00:04:43.695 --> 00:04:47.220
HARRY POTTER,
YOU MUST LEAVE.

00:04:47.264 --> 00:04:49.353
YOU ARE KNOWN
TO MANY CREATURES HERE.

00:04:49.396 --> 00:04:52.182
THE FOREST IS NOT SAFE
AT THIS TIME,

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.966
ESPECIALLY FOR YOU.

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:56.708
BUT WHAT WAS THAT THING
YOU SAVED ME FROM?

00:04:56.751 --> 00:04:58.884
A MONSTROUS CREATURE.

00:04:58.928 --> 00:05:02.148
IT IS A TERRIBLE CRIME
TO SLAY A UNICORN.

00:05:02.192 --> 00:05:04.194
DRINKING THE BLOOD
OF A UNICORN

00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:05.369
WILL KEEP YOU ALIVE,

00:05:05.412 --> 00:05:08.067
EVEN IF YOU ARE
AN INCH FROM DEATH.

00:05:08.111 --> 00:05:10.243
BUT AT A TERRIBLE PRICE.

00:05:10.287 --> 00:05:12.942
FOR YOU HAVE SLAIN
SOMETHING SO PURE

00:05:12.985 --> 00:05:16.293
THAT FROM THE MOMENT
THE BLOOD TOUCHES YOUR LIPS,

00:05:16.336 --> 00:05:18.425
YOU WILL HAVE A HALF-LIFE.

00:05:18.469 --> 00:05:20.384
A CURSED LIFE.

00:05:20.427 --> 00:05:22.473
BUT WHO WOULD CHOOSE
SUCH A LIFE?

00:05:22.516 --> 00:05:24.518
CAN YOU THINK
OF NO ONE?

00:05:24.562 --> 00:05:26.390
DO YOU MEAN TO SAY

00:05:26.433 --> 00:05:29.610
THAT THAT THING
THAT KILLED THE UNICORN,

00:05:29.654 --> 00:05:32.135
THAT WAS DRINKING
ITS BLOOD,

00:05:32.178 --> 00:05:33.832
THAT WAS VOLDEMORT?

00:05:33.876 --> 00:05:35.747
DO YOU KNOW WHAT IS HIDDEN
IN THE SCHOOL

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:37.967
AT THIS VERY MOMENT,
MR. POTTER?

00:05:39.925 --> 00:05:41.666
THE PHILOSOPHER'S STONE.

00:05:41.709 --> 00:05:42.928
[FANG BARKING]

00:05:42.972 --> 00:05:45.452
Hermione: HARRY!

00:05:45.496 --> 00:05:46.932
HELLO THERE, FIRENZE.

00:05:46.976 --> 00:05:50.153
I SEE YOU'VE MET
OUR YOUNG MR. POTTER.

00:05:50.196 --> 00:05:51.284
YOU ALL RIGHT THERE, HARRY?

00:05:53.417 --> 00:05:55.027
HARRY POTTER,

00:05:55.071 --> 00:05:58.465
THIS IS WHERE I LEAVE YOU.

00:05:58.509 --> 00:06:00.815
YOU'RE SAFE NOW.

00:06:00.859 --> 00:06:02.687
GOOD LUCK.

00:06:09.999 --> 00:06:13.306
YOU MEAN, YOU-KNOW-WHO'S
OUT THERE, RIGHT NOW,

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.568
IN THE FOREST?

00:06:14.612 --> 00:06:15.656
BUT HE'S WEAK.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.310
HE'S LIVING OFF
THE UNICORNS.

00:06:17.354 --> 00:06:20.139
DON'T YOU SEE?
WE HAD IT WRONG.

00:06:20.183 --> 00:06:22.620
SNAPE DOESN'T WANT
THE STONE FOR HIMSELF.

00:06:22.663 --> 00:06:25.188
HE WANTS THE STONE
FOR VOLDEMORT.

00:06:25.231 --> 00:06:26.406
WITH THE ELIXIR OF LIFE,

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.147
VOLDEMORT WILL
BE STRONG AGAIN.

00:06:28.191 --> 00:06:29.975
HE'LL--

00:06:30.019 --> 00:06:31.759
HE'LL COME BACK.

00:06:31.803 --> 00:06:33.631
BUT IF HE COMES BACK,

00:06:33.674 --> 00:06:37.809
YOU DON'T THINK HE'LL TRY
TO KILL YOU, DO YOU?

00:06:37.852 --> 00:06:39.767
I THINK IF HE'D HAD
THE CHANCE,

00:06:39.811 --> 00:06:41.378
HE MIGHT HAVE TRIED
TO KILL ME TONIGHT.

00:06:41.421 --> 00:06:44.468
AND TO THINK
I'VE BEEN WORRYING

00:06:44.511 --> 00:06:46.383
ABOUT MY POTIONS FINAL.

00:06:46.426 --> 00:06:47.384
Hermione:
HANG ON A MINUTE.

00:06:47.427 --> 00:06:49.908
WE'RE FORGETTING
ONE THING.

00:06:49.952 --> 00:06:55.131
WHO'S THE ONE WIZARD
VOLDEMORT ALWAYS FEARED?

00:06:55.174 --> 00:06:57.263
DUMBLEDORE.

00:06:57.307 --> 00:06:59.222
AS LONG AS DUMBLEDORE'S
AROUND, HARRY,

00:06:59.265 --> 00:07:00.919
YOU'RE SAFE.

00:07:00.963 --> 00:07:02.173
AS LONG AS
DUMBLEDORE'S AROUND,
